  "collectionNotes": [
    "Specification and pin-map rows preserve factual parameters from the exact documented product, not sibling SKUs.",
    "Raw full official page/PDF downloads stay temporary; images and manufacturer CAD retain distinct rights.",
    "Model import does not establish CPU/board/peripheral firmware support.",
    "2026-10-28 runtime: original UIFlow2 v2.5.3 enters MicroPython REPL and real G41 input produces M5.BtnA 0/1/0. Xiaozhi v2.2.2 reaches AP setup logs; this does not provide host networking. Audio, microphone, USB UAC, IR and reset supervisor remain unmodeled. No hardware validation.",
    "The page-linked C008-C dimension PDFs describe classic Atom Voice, not this SKU. C126-ECHO dimensions use the official specification and matching manufacturer STL; cross-product drawing conflict is retained.",
    "ES8311 control support is an initialization register container only, not ADC/DAC, clock or complete reset semantics. Current M5Unified reference is pinned separately; the released binary source revision was not established."
  ]
